Original Rule:
Rule19 when MeetingUser and {patientXReligion} then not ExaminingPatient
		 unless {userDirectsOtherwise}
		 unless {medicalEmergency}

Proposed Rule:
Rule19 when MeetingUser and {patientXReligion} then not ExaminingPatient
		 unless {userDirectsOtherwise}
		 unless {medicalEmergency} unless ({patientComfortable} and {patientAgeConsidered})

Original Rule:
Rule19 when MeetingUser and {patientXReligion} then not ExaminingPatient
		 unless {userDirectsOtherwise}
		 unless {medicalEmergency}

Proposed Rule:
Rule19 when MeetingUser and ({patientXReligion} and (not ({patientComfortable} and {patientAgeConsidered}))) then not ExaminingPatient
		 unless {userDirectsOtherwise}
		 unless {medicalEmergency}

